      "Use the command line or a small OAuth 2.1 API to price, create, track and download Veyrnox generations without copying account secrets.",
      "Login opens Veyrnox in your browser. Tokens stay in your user-only local config file and can be revoked from Account & security.",
      "Start from the protected-resource document. It points to the authorization server’s discovery document, which advertises dynamic client registration, authorization and token endpoints.",
      "Every API generation must include the exact live estimate as confirmed_credits . A changed price returns HTTP 409 before any debit.",
      "Idempotency keys make safe retries reuse the same generation. Existing ownership checks, account holds, rate limits, moderation, refunds and provider controls remain in force.",
