    "text": "This first version saves one studio per signed-in account in browser storage, scoped by user ID. It does not use the still-preview tenant Projects API. There is no migration or additional server access path. Browser drafts are cleared on sign-out or account change, like existing chat drafts; the interface asks users to export before signing out. Signed-out work stays in memory and can be exported. JSON import validates the schema, size, bounds and identifiers, then asks before replacing the current workspace. The ZIP export contains the entire folder structure, passports, tests, all prompt versions, generation log, separate text tasks and accepted-take manifests in selects. Media files stay in the Library or the external workflow and are referenced by stable identifiers. The export does not download media.",
    "source": "docs/product/film-studio.md",
